        "href": "https://blog.oiyo.net/ko/tool-chinese-zodiac/",
        "label": "중국 띠 계산기 가이드",
        "desc": "12지신과 출생 연도 기준을 쉽게 정리했습니다."
      }
    ],
    "disclaimer": "띠 궁합은 오락과 자기 성찰 목적입니다. 관계, 결혼, 가족 결정을 대신하지 않습니다."
  },
  "en": {
    "faqTitle": "Frequently asked questions",
    "readingTitle": "Read more",
    "introTitle": "Chinese zodiac compatibility reads the rhythm of the 12 animals, not a final verdict",
    "intro": "Chinese zodiac compatibility looks at trines, six harmonies, and opposing tensions. Use it as a cultural language for discussing pace and expectations, not as a judgment on whether two people should be together.",
    "conceptTitle": "Compatibility basics",
    "concepts": [
